<title>UK: UBS sets call warrants on Novartis.</title>
<headline>UBS sets call warrants on Novartis.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Bank of Switzerland said it has issued 10 million American-style call warrants on registered shares of Novartis AG.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 20 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1,650 CHF		 PREMIUM	12.0 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     3.75 CHF		  GEARING	20.5 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 30.JAN.97-16.JAN.98   PAYDATE	30.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWX			 MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  1,540 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
